#: ../../tinylang-spec.md:1
msgid "TinyLang Specification"
msgstr "TinyLang Specification"

#: ../../tinylang-spec.md:3
msgid "TinyLang is a minimal demo markup language designed to showcase how to add language support to lang-check. It is intentionally trivial — just complex enough to demonstrate prose extraction, math exclusion, and structural commands."
msgstr "TinyLang is a minimal demo markup language designed to showcase how to add language support to lang-check. It is intentionally trivial — just complex enough to demonstrate prose extraction, math exclusion, and structural commands."

#: ../../tinylang-spec.md:7
msgid "File Extension"
msgstr "File Extension"

#: ../../tinylang-spec.md:9
msgid "`.tiny`"
msgstr "`.tiny`"

#: ../../tinylang-spec.md:11
msgid "Syntax"
msgstr "Syntax"

#: ../../tinylang-spec.md:13
msgid "Prose Text"
msgstr "Prose Text"

#: ../../tinylang-spec.md:15
msgid "Any text that isn't inside a special construct is **prose** and will be grammar-checked."
msgstr "Any text that isn't inside a special construct is **prose** and will be grammar-checked."

